%SIXMD 1
# @?TR - TRANSLATE CHARACTERS IN S6REC RECORDS

## DESCRIPTION

TRANSLATES CHARACTERS POSITIONALLY FROM THE FIRST SET TO THE SECOND SET.

USAGE IS 'TR FROM TO'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/TR
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/TR.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

